     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi everyone<div><br></div><div>Just thought I&#39;d post something to let you know I&#39;ve been developing some interactive population modelling apps with shiny. Don&#39;t have a gist set up for them at the moment but if anyone wants the code just ask - they&#39;re mostly using deSolve to give solutions for the differential equations. I&#39;ll be using these as part of my population ecology course that I teach and I hope they&#39;ll make it easier for me to convince a bunch of biology students that mathematical modelling can be useful.</div><div><br></div><div>These are the ones that are ready for prime-time so far, more to follow.</div><div><br></div><div><a href=\"http://87.117.69.131:3838/Logistic/\" rel=\"nofollow nofollow\" style=\"color:rgb(59,89,152);font-family:&#39;lucida grande&#39;,tahoma,verdana,arial,sans-serif;line-height:17px\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://87.117.69.131:3838/Logistic/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792406786117000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1gp2S8j4-d8uweZJQDDsj9\">http://87.117.69.131:3838/Logistic/</a><br style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&#39;lucida grande&#39;,tahoma,verdana,arial,sans-serif;line-height:17px\"><br style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&#39;lucida grande&#39;,tahoma,verdana,arial,sans-serif;line-height:17px\"><a href=\"http://87.117.69.131:3838/Lotka_Volterra_Competition/\" rel=\"nofollow nofollow\" style=\"color:rgb(59,89,152);font-family:&#39;lucida grande&#39;,tahoma,verdana,arial,sans-serif;line-height:17px\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://87.117.69.131:3838/Lotka_Volterra_Competition/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792406786117000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2yNHY1zussaUwXy20VbZwg\">http://87.117.69.131:3838/Lotka_Volterra_Competition/</a><br style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&#39;lucida grande&#39;,tahoma,verdana,arial,sans-serif;line-height:17px\"><br style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-famil